ga9J(){return"The sync copy"},
ga9L(){return"On each linked device, open Sync, in Profile on a phone or in Settings on a computer."},
ga9M(){return"Choose \u201cStop sync on this device\u201d."},
ga9N(){return"Once no device syncs anymore, the relay erases the encrypted copy after 180 days. It cannot read it and does not know who it belongs to."},
ga9F(){return"Your account"},
ga9B(){return"If you have an account, delete it in the app (Account and sync, Delete my account) or at app.mirinu.ch/#/supprimer, without installing the app. Your account and your encrypted library are erased from the relay 7 days after your request; until then, you can cancel. What is on your devices stays there."},
ga9I(){return"A question"},
